# DeepSeek-OCR weight manifest — deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-OCR, pinned at revision
# 9f30c71f441d010e5429c532364a86705536c53a. Single source of truth: the runtime
# staging path (model_stager.rs, via include_str!) reads this file. Update the model
# → edit here only.
#
# Covers exactly the files DeepseekOCREngine::init() reads: config.json,
# tokenizer.json, model.safetensors.index.json, and every shard the index's
# weight_map names. At this revision the index names a single shard,
# model-00001-of-000001.safetensors (6,672,547,120 bytes) — its checksum is the
# upstream LFS sha256, not a git blob oid. The shard list is enumerated from the
# index; if a future revision reshards the weights, the index and this manifest's
# shard entries must be updated together.
